{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.SaddleQShiftOffset","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.SaddleQShiftOffset","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Field.Basic"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hbarQ_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hbarQ_one","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SaddleQShiftOffset.lean#L60-L63","doc":"**Boundary condition.** At the symmetric point `q = 1`, `ℏ_q = 0`, so the\noffset vanishes: the saddle configuration is centred. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.saddle_offset_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.saddle_offset_norm","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SaddleQShiftOffset.lean#L54-L58","doc":"**Offset magnitude.** `‖w/q − w‖ = ‖w‖ · ‖ℏ_q‖` — the offset magnitude is\n`|z*|` times the quantum Planck constant, vanishing at `q = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.saddle_offset_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.saddle_offset_eq","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SaddleQShiftOffset.lean#L45-L52","doc":"**Offset identity.** Under the base shift `z ↦ q·z`, a saddle point `w`\n(root of the colour-cubic discriminant) maps to `w/q`, and the offset is\n`w/q − w = −ℏ_q · w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.hbarQ","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/SaddleQShiftOffset.lean#L42-L43","doc":"The quantum Planck constant `ℏ_q := 1 − q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}